WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.154
Téné ni jinɛw ka mankan. O tun ye maana dɔ ye.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.120
Sɔgɔma wulafɛ, Ziè tun be balafɔni kɛra dugu kɔnɔ.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.570
O kɔ, Téné tun be dansi kɛra. A tun b'o fɔlifɛnw kanu ka tɛmɛ fɛɛn bɛɛ kan.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.660
Loon dɔ sufɛ, dɔnkilila wɛrɛ bɔra yiritu la. A cɛ ka ɲi ka tɛmɛ Ziye ta kan. O fana ka kan ka kɛ yɔrɔjan.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.778
Téné kununna ani mankan ma bɔ a kaan na. A bɔra a ka dilan kan, ka taga mankan fɛ.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.976
Yɔrɔ dɔ la, yirituw tun b'a fɛ ka kalo ta.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.818
Téné y'a daminɛ ka dɔn kɛ, a ma se k'a to. Hakilitigiw tun b'a lamini.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:35.528
A tun ɲinɛna a tɔgɔ, a bamuso ani a ka dugudennin kɔ.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.400
O dugusagwɛ sɔgɔmada joona fɛ, sinɔgɔ tun tɛ yen.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:52.950
N' y'a fɔ i ye ko: Ne denmuso tɛ yan tugun!

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.568
Mɔgɔ si m'a ye wa?

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:02.095
Loon dɔ sufɛ, n' y'a mɛn ko mɔgɔw be tulogwɛlɛnw kɛra yiritu kɔnɔ.

00:02:02.095 --> 00:02:03.487
Hakilitigiw!

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:20.512
An tagara dozo jagokɛlaw yɔrɔ, yiritu kɔrɔsibagaw.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.900
N'i b'a fɛ i ka n' denmuso di ne ma, ne b'i daali.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.840
An bena taga bi sufɛ.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:38.180
A k'a ta nɛgɛbɛnnanw flɛ. O kɔ, a ka a ta sowotoro kɔrɔta. O kɔ, u tagara n'u ka wulu ye.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:55.786
U tagamana suu bɛɛ. Wuluw kasa tun b'a la.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:10.818
Ka fara o kan, dɔnkilila tun be bɔ yɔrɔjan. Cɛɛw lɔra, o kɔ, u jera.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:32.882
Dozo kuntigi y'a ka kɛlɛkɛminanw kɔrɔta. Sanmanamana dɔ nana bɔ, o bɛɛ banna.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.288
Aw ye den nin di a bamuso ma.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:47.656
Hakili senu kuntigi tun be sigasigara ani a sɔnna.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.786
I k'i yɛrɛ tanga o fɔlifɛn ma. A ye i ta ye.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:59.856
A k'a to Tenɛ ye sunɔgɔ, min kununa i ko sikojan.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:19.828
O kɔ, Téné y'a fɔ a ye ko: "N' tun b'i fɛ ka suman tigɛ. O kɔ, dugumɔgɔw bɛɛ ye dɔɔn kɛ.
